  (text "SW1 (IO9/BOOT): 1 lan = do & bao cao ngay / mo commissioning;\n2 lan = hieu chuan KHO; 3 lan = hieu chuan UOT; giu >=10s = factory\nreset. Giu SW1 khi cap nguon/reset = che do nap (download)."
    (at 20.32 27.94 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left top))
    (uuid f72c588e-7e47-5103-81ad-5fb335b08142)
  )
  (text "J1: 1=3V3 2=GND 3=TXD0 4=RXD0 5=EN 6=IO9 7=USB_D- 8=USB_D+\nUSB-Serial/JTAG: lap pin + noi D+/D-/GND (khong noi 3V3).\nUART: thao pin, cap 3V3 tu adapter USB-UART 3.3V."
